摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Inject WSL/Windows path and shell facts into the DeepSeek Harness system prompt.","id":"gh:1338530482","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-wsl-env","slug":"173787247/dsh-wsl-env","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","wsl"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Inject WSL/Windows path and shell facts into the DeepSeek Harness system prompt."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-wsl-env\n> **Install set:** part of dsh-wsl-kit. Prefer `KIT_SET=daily` | `llm` | `github` | `f"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"ull` (see kit README). Fault tree: TROUBLESHOOTING.md."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: inject **WSL / Windows** path and shell facts into the system prompt."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Part of **dsh-wsl-kit**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明 → README.zh.md"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Where it sits"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Injects WSL and Windows path facts into the system prompt. It is not a tool the model calls."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Suite diagram and version snapshot: dsh-wsl-kit. This plugin is **0.3.0** (daily; also in llm). Do n"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ot copy that matrix into this README."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Field | Value |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **Plugin** | `dsh-wsl-env` **0.3.0** |\n| **Minimum dsh** | ≥ **0.1.2** (web UI one-shot `?token=` "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"on Windows relay `:3081`) |\n| **Latest verified** | See dsh-wsl-kit Compatibility (currently **`0.2."},{"id":"p12s3","text":"2-rc.1`**) — single source of truth for the suite |\n| **Kit set** | `daily` (also in `github` / `ful"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"l`; fetch+net also in `llm`) |\n| **Cloud Flash** | Use model id **`deepseek-flash`** (V4.1 Flash) in"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" `~/.dsh/settings.yaml` / `llm-deepseek` — not configured by this plugin |\n| **Agent Teams** | Upstr"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"eam experimental; not required here |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Suite floor versions: kit `check-plugin-versions.sh`. Fault tree: TROUBLESHOOTING.md."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The model often assumes a Windows shell (`C:\\`, PowerShell) even when the agent runs in Linux/WSL. T"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"his plugin adds a short system-prompt section so it prefers Linux paths, understands `/mnt/c`, and k"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"nows about Node 24 proxy quirks."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## What gets injected"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Kept short on purpose:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Distro name and Linux user\n- Linux path mapping (`C:\\Users\\...` → `/mnt/c/Users/...`)\n- CRLF / git"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" caveats on `/mnt/c`\n- Prefer Linux home over the Windows mount for day-to-day work\n- `NODE_USE_ENV_"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"PROXY=1` when Node 24 must use `HTTP(S)_PROXY`"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`. Open a **new** session (existing sessions keep the old prompt)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. Send any message.\n2. Trajectory → **SYSTEM** → **System Prompt** (not the Tools tab).\n3. Search f"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"or `Windows Subsystem for Linux`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"You should see the distro name and path mapping. The UI concatenates sections, so the internal id `r"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"untime:wsl-windows` may not appear as a heading."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Non-WSL hosts skip injection by default (`when: wsl`)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Later profile layers that set `config` **replace the whole object**—restate every key you keep:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| `when` | `wsl` | Inject only in WSL, or `always` |\n| `order` | `15` | Prompt section order |\n| `ex"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"traNotes` | `\"\"` | Extra operator notes appended to the section |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Test"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
